# API Gateway Configuration
# 
# NOTE: This file is for reference only.
# The actual configuration should be in the root .env file of the workspace.
# 
# The API Gateway reads these environment variables:
# - API_GATEWAY_ADDRESS (default: 0.0.0.0:8080)
# - USER_SERVICE_URL (default: http://localhost:3001) 
# - ORDER_SERVICE_URL (default: http://localhost:3002)
# - JWT_SECRET (required for production)
# - JWT_EXPIRY_HOURS (default: 24)
#
# See ../.env for the actual configuration values.
